    form inquiry -> INQ-00001
    [inquiry-delete (an early converted one, no quote)] success: Inquiry INQ-2610-001 deleted.
    [lead-convert] success: Converted. The customer is on the master and an inquiry has been raised — carry on from there.
    unique index on crm_inquiries.inquiry_no: ix_quo_inquiry

